OL,3,GNEWSACouncil chief executive goes on
OL,4,Aleave of absence
OL,5,
OL,6,FCornwall Council has put "interim
OL,7,Fleadership arrangements" after it
OL,8,Fannounced chief executive officer Kate
OL,9,FKennally is "on a leave of absence".
OL,11,FKennally joined the council as chief
OL,12,Fexecutive in 2016 from the London
OL,13,Fborough of Barnet, where she was the
OL,14,Fstrategic director for commissioning
OL,15,Fand deputy chief executive.
OL,17,FShe is the highest paid highest earner
OL,18,Fat Cornwall Council, with a base salary
OL,19,Fof #201,661, rising to #239,479
OL,20,Fincluding pension and expenses,
OL,21,Faccording to the Local Democracy
OL,22,FReporting Service.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
